  m_text: 'R-type instructions all share the same opcode, so the decode work is not
    finished yet.


    The funct field is the final 6 bits on the right side of
    the instruction, and it identifies which exact ALU operation this instruction
    is asking for.


    In this step, confirm the funct bits before the operand
    setup is unlocked.'
